<!--
  A heart with a medical cross cut out of its center: the same two
  motifs (heart + cross) the real Aarogya Sanjeevani logo already uses
  (website/src/assets/logo.png), simplified to one bold silhouette since
  an adaptive icon's foreground has to still read clearly at launcher-icon
  sizes, which that full illustration (stethoscope, ambulance, wordmark)
  never would. Drawn as one compound path with fillType="evenOdd" so the
  cross is a true geometric cutout: this renders correctly in every
  context the OS puts it in (full color on the teal background, a single
  tint color for the Android 13+ monochrome/themed variant, a shrunk
  preview in app info), not just the one case a color-matching trick
  would have covered.
-->
